WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.436
-You guys, the midterm elections
are on Tuesday,

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:05.405
and there are concerns
that low voter turnout

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:07.907
will affect the Democrats'
chances of taking back Congress.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:10.944
It's scary to think about Trump
continuing for two more years

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.545
without any checks and balances.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:13.980
So here with a kick-ass song

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.881
that's going to
make everyone vote,

00:00:15.881 --> 00:00:18.451
please welcome a fuzzy little
kitten named Liberty

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.453
and one of our writers,
Amber Ruffin.

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:25.458
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:28.227
♪ -On November 6th
we'll be in the same place ♪

00:00:28.227 --> 00:00:31.331
♪ At the ballot box
with a happy look on our face ♪

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:33.532
♪ Knowing that we're stopping
this here country ♪

00:00:33.532 --> 00:00:35.368
♪ From going to the [bleep] ♪

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:36.803
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:38.604
♪ Get registered and vote ♪

00:00:38.604 --> 00:00:40.340
♪ This here song is my plea ♪

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.942
♪ I'm begging you
on behalf of Liberty ♪

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:46.779
♪ 'Cause if you don't vote,
I'll [bleep] kill this kitten ♪

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:47.813
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.813 --> 00:00:49.882
-Amber --
-Somebody's got to do something!

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:51.951
This election is too important!

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:54.954
♪ This wasn't the best way
to make new friends ♪

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.522
♪ But there'll be no time
for hanging ♪

00:00:56.522 --> 00:00:57.824
♪ When the world frigging ends ♪

00:00:57.824 --> 00:00:59.458
♪ So vote right now ♪

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:01.994
♪ Or I'll throw this
little kitten in a blender ♪

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:03.396
-Amber, Amber, this is --

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:07.033
-We tried your "Closer Look"
crap! It doesn't work!

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:09.635
♪ If you don't vote
this will be the end ♪

00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:12.539
♪ Say goodbye to your cute
little furry friend ♪

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:14.807
♪ 'Cause I swear to God ♪

00:01:14.807 --> 00:01:16.643
♪ I'll flush him
right down the toilet ♪

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:18.478
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:21.581
♪ So if you don't vote,
then say goodbye ♪

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:24.483
♪ I'm gonna shoot this tiny baby
up into the sky ♪

00:01:24.483 --> 00:01:28.454
♪ I'll strap his little body to
a rocket and blow him to bits ♪

00:01:28.454 --> 00:01:30.289
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.289 --> 00:01:37.496
♪ Please try to understand
I'm a desperate woman ♪

00:01:37.496 --> 00:01:42.635
♪ Vote or I'll get him
addicted to tobacco ♪

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:45.338
♪ He'll be a smoker ♪

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:47.173
♪ It's a long, slow death ♪

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:48.841
♪ 2, 3, 4 ♪

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:51.377
♪ If you vote, then Liberty
will be your friend ♪

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:54.214
♪ If you don't, I swear to God
you'll never see him again ♪

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:55.815
♪ So vote right now ♪

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:58.751
♪ Or I'll feed him poison
wrapped inside a hot dog ♪

00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:00.586
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.586 --> 00:02:03.355
♪ This song was just a joke ♪

00:02:03.355 --> 00:02:04.891
♪ The cat is fine ♪

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:09.528
♪ We just want you to vote
but your country might not be ♪

00:02:09.528 --> 00:02:13.032
♪ Vote in the midterms ♪

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:15.935
♪ Or it will be the figurative ♪

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:17.970
♪ Not literal death of
the concept, not the cat ♪

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:23.142
♪ Who was fine but the state of
being free called libertyyyyy ♪

00:02:23.142 --> 00:02:25.811
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:25.811 --> 00:02:27.947
Go vote!

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:29.415
-Amber and Liberty, everybody.

